Package: iphone-import
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GNOME Cloud Sync Prototype <prototype@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), gvfs-backends, usbmuxd
Recommends: nautilus
Description: Browse and import media from an iPhone on GNOME
 Uses the GNOME Files device integration to browse USB-connected iPhones
 and copies photos and videos to a local folder.
